# Go build and test artifacts.
# Migrated from the upstream JavaScript .gitignore, whose entries
# (node_modules, yarn.lock, coverage, .nyc_output) have no Go meaning.
# vendor/ is deliberately committed, not ignored: the differential oracles in
# tools/ already require a pinned upstream checkout, so the Go side pins its
# own dependencies the same way and builds without network access.
*.test
*.exe
coverage.out
coverage.html
.DS_Store
